# Mobile UI

- Screens: wrap with `ThemedScreen`. Colors from `useTheme()` / `useThemedStyles` — no one-off palettes.
- Primitives: `Button`, `Card`, `Input`, `spacing` from `constants/theme.ts`.
- Strings: add a key to `lib/i18n.ts` and use `t('key')`.
- Layout: `rtl` helpers in `lib/rtl.ts`. Do not call `I18nManager.forceRTL`.
- Data: add HTTP methods in `lib/api.ts` only; load on focus with `useFocusLoad`.
- Themes: `ember` | `minecraft` | `brawl` | `roblox` | `sparkle` in `constants/themes.ts`. Depend styles on `theme.id`.
- Kid tabs play BGM (`lib/bgm.ts`); keep SFX behind `playSfx`.
- Expo APIs must exist in SDK 57. Routes live under `app/` (expo-router).
